# ============================================================================
# TEAM WHITEHAT DEV — HARDENED SECURITY .GITIGNORE PROTOCOL
# Prevents accidental commits of sensitive credentials, API keys, tokens,
# environment variables, private certificates, and local database dumps.
# ============================================================================

